<title>JAPAN: Tostem files 60 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Tostem files 60 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tostem Corp said on Wednesday that it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 60 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective for two years from January 15.</p>
</text>
